a5966.mp4?t=1748596330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The <strong>Tower</strong> grants you few seconds to act freely during your turn, make sure to use them wisely by learning and master your weapons combo and special attacks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One player, Two characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1169520/extras/5e19efc35e11baa500a3408a056da3bb.poster.avif?t=1748596330\" width=540 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1169520/extras/5e19efc35e11baa500a3408a056da3bb.webm?t=1748596330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1169520/extras/5e19efc35e11baa500a3408a056da3bb.mp4?t=1748596330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If your group wants to succeed in the <strong>Tower</strong>, it must plan and act in perfect harmony, like they are sharing the same mind.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect the loot</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1169520/extras/744f5731e1ed520c274bb7458857f644.poster.avif?t=1748596330\" width=540 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1169520/extras/744f5731e1ed520c274bb7458857f644.webm?t=1748596330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1169520/extras/744f5731e1ed520c274bb7458857f644.mp4?t=1748596330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The <strong>Tower</strong> will reward you after each fight, keep the money and materials for the guild. <br>But make sure to ask for privileges that will help you during your next challenges, as climbing the <strong>Tower</strong> is no easy task.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft better 